00:00–00:10 How to Book a Job in Fieldd
00:10–00:20 Open the Fieldd App
00:20–00:30 Tap ‘New Job’ or ‘Add Booking’
00:30–00:40 Enter Customer Info
00:40–00:50 Choose Date, Time, and Service
00:50–01:00 Assign a Worker
01:00–01:10 Confirm and Save the Job